{"name":"Assur","status":"ok","title":"Assur","pageId":36402,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-frwiki pi-layout-default type-location\" role=\"region\">\n\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Maps_of_Assur\" title=\"Category:Maps of Assur\">Gallery</a></nav>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Assur</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Geography</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Type</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Small city</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Society</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"races\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Races</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/Humans\" title=\"Humans\">Humans</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Halfling\" title=\"Halfling\">Halflings</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Goblin\" title=\"Goblin\">Goblins</a><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FRCG-p118_1-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCG-p118-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">History</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"population1\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Population</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">5,000<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FRCG-p118_1-1\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCG-p118-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> in <a href=\"/wiki/1479_DR\" title=\"1479 DR\">1479 DR</a></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n</aside>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Assur</b> was a small port city in <a href=\"/wiki/Durpar\" title=\"Durpar\">Durpar</a>.  The city was destroyed by <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/Giants\" title=\"Giants\">giants</a> from the <a href=\"/wiki/Beastlands\" title=\"Beastlands\">Beastlands</a> but was rebuilt as a fortress city with a large garrison.  The city had a deep harbor and a large market.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FRCG-p118_1-2\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCG-p118-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"References\">References</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: References\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Assur?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: References\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"reflist\" style=\"\">\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite_note-FRCG-p118-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-FRCG-p118_1-0\">1.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-FRCG-p118_1-1\">1.1</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-FRCG-p118_1-2\">1.2</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bruce_R._Cordell\" title=\"Bruce R. Cordell\">Bruce R. Cordell</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Ed_Greenwood\" title=\"Ed Greenwood\">Ed Greenwood</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Chris_Sims\" title=\"Chris Sims\">Chris Sims</a> (August 2008). <i><a href=\"/wiki/Forgo